Subject: [PATCH 015/102] arm64: dts: renesas: r8a77970: add FCPVD support
Date: Fri, 18 May 2018 13:14:37 +0200
Message-Id: <faa5c3176a67ed53a5bfefdf8b5e91dab9785d0d.1526637994.git.horms+renesas@verge.net.au>
